# Area: Researchers — the people behind the works
Every researcher behind a work taken into this phext,
with the work as it stands here and the standing of the
author check of charter rule 15. The check asks two
things: whether the authors stand in any recorded tie to
phext or to Will's work, and whether the work uses Will's
earlier published work without naming it. Rule 15 was
laid down on 2026-11-07, after Papers 001-005 and Studies
S001-S003 were already in; those entries are marked NOT
CHECKED — the rule did not yet stand. That is a fact of
the record, not a gap quietly left: no verdict is carried
for a check that was never run. Will is not an entry
here: the stream is his, the works are theirs.

